    "The published N3 sample is a small, selected passenger-EV corridor dataset and is not representative of the national EV fleet or heavy-duty truck depots.",
    "Do not combine charging-event energy quantities with a trip unless the underlying start/end SOC and charger-session association are independently resolved."
